      "writtenOn": "2026-05-13T09:13:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@milutin@google.com, @dhruvsri@google.com\n\nWould you agree with this behavioural change for the upcoming release 3.14.0? From the Google perspective, does it make sense to hide the action for anonymous users, given that submitting AI review feedback already requires login?",
      "revId": "0611e357f4f2c5fffaaf8d545ee980b5d66a2e87",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "70867b7a_bfe17926",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1006192
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-13T10:09:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am in favour of removing the \"Create AI Review Prompt\" button for anonymous users, but that would create a regression for Google. So I am waiting for @dhruvsri@google.com or @milutin@google.com to express their views.",
      "revId": "0611e357f4f2c5fffaaf8d545ee980b5d66a2e87",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "67adc9dc_05f79b67",
        "filename": "java/com/google/gerrit/server/change/ActionJson.java",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 241,
      "author": {
        "id": 1006192
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-12T11:46:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This will actually *show* the AI review action, because it\u0027s enabled by default.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 239,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 241,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "0611e357f4f2c5fffaaf8d545ee980b5d66a2e87",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "600e35ac_b65561c8",
        "filename": "java/com/google/gerrit/server/change/ActionJson.java",
